      "content": "therapists cant pay the debt. they cant fix the fact that i'm basically bankrupt and a disgrace. i keep thinking that if i just wasn't here, the burden on them would actually stop. like, if i'm gone, the debt stays but the shame goes with me. it's just a huge, permanent problem that i can't outrun. is it even rational to keep struggling like this when the math just doesnt add up anymore?",
